          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I wonder who built this place, and for what purpose? The handiwork doesn’t look dwarvish, but it’s far too old to have been tunneled by men. Their— err, our kind has barely been on the Great Continent for 500 years!"),
          },
