          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Hey. I’m Harper. Aren’t you a sight for sore eyes."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("You’re the leader of the outlaws? Err, we came to rescue you, and to put an end to the undead threat on the isle. What happened in this place?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Well... some weeks ago I led some hunters down here lookin’ fer magic, treasure, anythin’ that could help really make a difference ’gainst that stinker Queen Asheviere. Really thought I’d found somethin’ too."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("’stead all my hard work just got people killed. I awoke that “Midnight Queen”, an’ now I’m the last one of us who came down here what’s left alive..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("But there be no time for talk. C’mon, we gots to finish her off afore she gets her glamour put back on!"),
